    <element xsi:type="archimate:ApplicationComponent" name="Preprocessor" id="id-460abab375434254839a5d435c815e78">
      <documentation>#  testapp

Application to test linage functionality

```xml
&lt;app>
        &lt;database name=&quot;test&quot;>
            &lt;calls>
                &lt;call name=&quot;load_customer_lineage&quot;/>
            &lt;/calls>
        &lt;/database>
 &lt;/app>
 ```</documentation>
